# "This land enters tapped unless you control a planeswalker": Bot1 controls Karn, Scion of Urza (cast with Sol Ring and
# two Moxen), so its Transformative Commons enters untapped and taps for {U}; White is not among its colors (refused beside the positive
# control). Bot2, with no planeswalker of its own - Bot1's does not count - plays its Transformative Commons tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Karn, Scion of Urza
Transformative Commons
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Transformative Commons
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Karn, Scion of Urza.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Transformative Commons.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Transformative Commons.Tapped = false
! Bot1.Battlefield.Transformative Commons.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Transformative Commons.Activate(Color: Blue)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Transformative Commons.Play

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Karn, Scion of Urza.Counters.Loyalty = 5
Bot2.Battlefield.Transformative Commons.Tapped = true
